WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.379
Learn to determine basic division fact up to 81

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:12.172
Find 48 divided by 6. The answer is 8. Because 8 times 6 equals 48, 48 divided by 6

00:00:12.172 --> 00:00:13.011
equals 8.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:19.435
A teacher puts 36 mangoes into sets of 4. How many full sets can she make? Pause and

00:00:19.435 --> 00:00:21.291
solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:25.701
The answer is 9. 4 times 9 equals 36.
